ll around... buy it now to secure it ... or be on your toes .. SATURDAY NIGHT ...THANK YOU. https://newyork.craigslist.org/mnh/cto/d/niceville-96-pontiac-door-bubbletop/7938204663.html On Jun-02-26 at 20:33:24 PDT, seller added the following information: On TUESDAY NIGHT i noticed that a video finally loaded of the original 389 motor starting on this ad. This was before the car was fueled ... now the car RUNS OFF OF THE FUEL TANK ...AND THE OLD, OLD MECHANICAL FACTORY STYLE FUEL PUMP WORKS! THE CAR IDLES AND REVS UP!!!.. I DID PUT PLENTY OF MARVEL MYSTERY OIL IN WITH THE FUEL TO LUBE EVERYTHING UP. BUT IN MY OPINION...THE CAR SMOKES MORE THAN WHAT THE BURNING MARVEL/PREMIUM UNLEADED MIX WOULD CREATE. I COULD BE WRONG BUT IN GOOD FAITH I AM SAYING MOTOR NEEDS RINGS OR AT LEAST VALVE SEALS... BUT MOTOR DOES NOT KNOCK. If this car is not for you...PLEASE FORWARD THIS LISTING TO A FRIEND..OR FRIENDS... THIS OLD BABY IS SPECIAL.. THANKS!",gas,23,,,,,57000,,1,2026-06-03T9:53:08.773760,,CAL CAR CULTURE JEWEL 96 BUBBLETOP PONTIAC BONNEVILLE HEADTURNER,clean,,automatic,,,,
