342,good,8 cylinders,rwd,,,,1,"QR Code Link to This Post This is a 1 of a kind 8.2 Liter Detroit Diesel with 68,000.00 original miles. I made a HUGE Mistake by taking it to the most corrupt Diesel Mechanic ""All American Deisel & Fleets Services Inc. in Orange County To have a top end rebuild done that was supposed to cover Head Gasket repair or replacement done and a Radiator, Hoses, Water Pump, Oil Cooler and Battery. I found that the Head Gasket work was not completed no fluids were filled not even coolant for the new radiator and after paying almost k I had to have police help me get the truck back. Days before I filled a formal complaint with the BAR's office. They Told me that a court ordered his license suspended since Sept 2025. I was not Notified So I am out Tens of Thousands of Dollars and have no time to finish my vision for it nor the space unfortunately. My Recommendation is to drop a certified regular gas engine in it for less than a Head Gasket repair and you would be solid. This is the perfect ruck for DIY Work Play Camp Conversion vehicle. If you are thinking of this for your business, there is no better form of advertisement! There isn't anything like it on the road and everywhere I go people are filming me on the freeway or asking if they can take pictures because of how tall it is, it's a blast to drive. It is Gun Metal Grey with Custom 38"" tires and Custom Built on a Fire Engine Chassis with lots of unique features, like the inground floor safe to the Chopped Slider windows and the double doors in the back up to the front Harley Davison Grill with Led Flashers you won't be disappointed. It's a blank canvas for the right person with the right vision. I need to Sell it Soon hence the 5K discount to offset the costs to repair and enhance a bit. Fun Project Vehicle an Excellent Advertising tool as well because heads literally turn when you're driving this BEAST!",diesel,10,,,,,68000,grey,15000,2026-06-02T20:41:18.297710,,"Custom 1988 Chevy P60 Thin