ly original, honest exampleâ€”not over-restored or modifiedâ€”offering a rare opportunity to own a low-mile, V12-powered XJS Cabriolet.",gas,23,,,,,59000,brown,19900,2026-06-03T19:35:17.049331,,"Extremely Rare 1995 Jaguar XJS 6.0 V12 Cabriolet â€“ 59,000 Actual Miles",clean,,automatic,,convertible,SAJNX2340SC198528,
